      "english": "Ben’s Diary – I Lost My Wallet"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "2018年10月3日 多云",
      "traditional": "2018年10月3日 多雲",
      "pinyin": "4 nián 1 yuè 1 rì duō yún",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "2018-10-03 Cloudy"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "今天我去打球，回来后发现我的钱包不见了。",
      "traditional": "今天我去打球，回來後發現我的錢包不見了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ qù dǎ qiú huí lái hòu fā xiàn wǒ de qián bāo bú jiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我的钱包里面有很多钱，这些钱是我这个月用来买菜的。",
      "traditional": "我的錢包裡面有很多錢，這些錢是我這個月用來買菜的。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de qián bāo lǐ miàn yǒu hěn duō qián zhè xiē qián shì wǒ zhè ge yuè yòng lái mǎi cài de",
      "english": "Today I went to play some ball. When I got back, I noticed that my wallet was missing."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "这可怎么办，这个月我没有钱买菜，没有钱吃饭了。",
      "traditional": "這可怎麼辦，這個月我沒有錢買菜，沒有錢吃飯了。",
      "pinyin": "zhè kě zěn me bàn zhè ge yuè wǒ méi yǒu qián mǎi cài méi yǒu qián chī fàn le",
      "english": "There was a lot of money in my wallet, and I was going to use this money for grocery shopping this month."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我很着急。",
      "traditional": "我很著急。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn zháo jí",
      "english": "What should I do? I had no money to buy groceries this month, and no money to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "后来，小雨知道了，她借了一些钱给我。",
      "traditional": "後來，小雨知道了，她借了一些錢給我。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái xiǎo yǔ zhī dào le tā jiè le yì xiē qián gěi wǒ",
      "english": "I was really flustered."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小雨说：“在家靠父母，出门靠朋友”。",
      "traditional": "小雨說：“在家靠父母，出門靠朋友”。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ shuō zài jiā kào fù mǔ chū mén kào péng you",
      "english": "Later, Little Yu found out about this and lent me some money."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "还好有小雨，如果没有小雨，我这个月就要饿肚子了。",
      "traditional": "還好有小雨，如果沒有小雨，我這個月就要餓肚子了。",
      "pinyin": "hái hǎo yǒu xiǎo yǔ rú guǒ méi yǒu xiǎo yǔ wǒ zhè ge yuè jiù yào è dù zi le",
      "english": "Little Yu said: “At home, we depend on our parents; outside we depend on our friends.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fortunately, Little Yu could help me. If it weren’t for Little Yu, I would have had to go hungry this month."
    }
  ],
