    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – I Lost My Wallet",
      "",
      "2018-10-03 Cloudy",
      "",
      "Today I went to play some ball. When I got back, I noticed that my wallet was missing.",
      "There was a lot of money in my wallet, and I was going to use this money for grocery shopping this month.",
      "What should I do? I had no money to buy groceries this month, and no money to eat.",
      "I was really flustered.",
      "Later, Little Yu found out about this and lent me some money.",
      "Little Yu said: “At home, we depend on our parents; outside we depend on our friends.”",
      "Fortunately, Little Yu could help me. If it weren’t for Little Yu, I would have had to go hungry this month.",
      ""
    ]
  }
